    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Get ready for MZD's 37th Season, Carte Blanche. We're launching the season in the best way possible... with a party in our new space!Join us to celebrate the opening of our new space, artistic beginnings and imaginings on October 15! Our fundraiser dance party will feature dance performances, DJ sets, art activities and refreshments."
