        "@value": "Advanced Contemporary Floorwork with Tia Ashley Kushniruk (亚 女弟)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;NEW MZD CLASS: Advanced Contemporary Floorwork with Tia Ashley Kushniruk (亚 女弟) The class draws on the techniques of house, breaking, limon, and capoeira for drill and basics, then amplifying (based on the participant) to higher stakes movement. Classes run Sundays at Mile Zero Dance, starting on March 17. Sundays, 2 - 4 PM $15 [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
