        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Join us for an MZD Workshop with Andrew de Lotbinière Harwood (Montreal)! WORKSHOP DATES April 5, 6 PM-9 PM April 6, 10 AM-4 PM April 7, 10 AM-4 PM REGISTRATION $200 | 3-Day Workshop $65 | Single Day Workshop Drop-in ABOUT THE WORKSHOP Each class will begin with a warm-up focusing on releasing and extending [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
